  {
   "id": "mudrunner-54789@post-2020-11-27",
   "gameId": "mudrunner-54789",
   "displayName": "Crossplay now available for Steam and the Epic Games Store!",
   "kind": "patch",
   "kindBasis": "inferred",
   "announcedAt": "2020-11-27T15:19:58.000Z",
   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "Changes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Hello MudRunners!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "With this small update, we're excited to introduce crossplay between Steam and the Epic Games Store.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": true,
       "category": "other",
       "platforms": [
        "pc"
       ]
      },
      {
       "text": "If you’re playing on Steam and want to play MudRunner with players on the Epic Games Store (EGS), you'll need to have an EGS account.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": true,
       "category": "other",
       "platforms": [
        "pc"
       ]
      },
      {
       "text": "When joining the multiplayer menu, you’ll be asked if you want to enable crossplay.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "If you don’t accept, you can only play with other Steam players that haven’t enabled crossplay.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "If you accept, a web page will open in your browser asking you to log in to (or create) an EGS account.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "To play MudRunner with friends from the Epic Game Store, you'll need to link your EGS account and Steam account.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "How to find my friends from the Epic Games Store",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "First, you must link your Steam and Epic Games account. Please follow these instructions.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": true,
       "category": "other",
       "platforms": [
        "pc"
       ]
      },
      {
       "text": "Once you've linked your accounts, a permission box will appear in your internet browser the next time you launch MudRunner on Steam.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": true,
       "category": "other",
       "platforms": [
        "pc"
       ]
      },
      {
       "text": "Finally, to find your Epic Friends on Steam, you need to allow this permission:",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": true,
       "category": "other",
       "platforms": [
        "pc"
       ]
      },
      {
       "text": "Now, after creating a lobby, you will find your EGS friends in the friends list.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": true,
       "category": "other",
       "platforms": [
        "pc"
       ]
      },
      {
       "text": "This update also fixes an issue with mods on Steam where mods created after June 2020 were not working in multiplayer.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": true,
       "category": "other",
       "platforms": [
        "pc"
       ]
      },
      {
       "text": "We hope you enjoy playing with your friends across both Steam and the EGS!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": true,
       "category": "other",
       "platforms": [
        "pc"
       ]
      },
      {
       "text": "In case you encounter major issues with this update, you can revert to the previous build.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": true,
       "category": "other",
       "platforms": [
        "pc"
       ]
      },
      {
       "text": "To do this, go to your library, right-click on MudRunner > Properties > BETAS > Select “vers_11_05_19”",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": true,
       "category": "other",
       "platforms": [
        "pc"
       ]
      },
      {
       "text": "Roll out, MudRunners!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": true,
       "category": "other",
       "platforms": [
        "pc"
       ]
      }
     ]
    }
   ],
