  {
   "id": "mudrunner-54789@patch-2019-08-07",
   "gameId": "mudrunner-54789",
   "displayName": "MudRunner Patch 07/08/2019",
   "kind": "patch",
   "kindBasis": "studio",
   "announcedAt": "2019-08-07T09:39:13.000Z",
   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "Changes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Hello MudRunners!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "We just put out a small update for MudRunner on PC, with a new addon for the GMC DW950 and some bug fixes. Here are the patch notes:",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": true,
       "category": "other",
       "platforms": [
        "pc"
       ]
      },
      {
       "text": "Fixed a sound-related crash",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "GMC DW950 now has its own unique cistern addon",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "2 new vehicle parameters exposed via XML for modders, both in \"Motor\" section:",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "EngineResponsiveness (defaults to 0.04), controls how fast the vehicle accelerates in response to user input.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "ClutchDelay (defaults to 0.1), idle engine time after changing gears in automatic gearbox mode.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Random addons don't spawn for vehicles in proving grounds",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "\"RELOAD\" in proving grounds now updates textures the same way as \"UPDATE\"",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Minor legacy camera position fixes",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "We know you're all eager for some news on the sequel, and trust us when we say we're eager to share some! Hold on tight, it's on the way. 🙂",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Have a good one!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    }
   ],
